I'm fine, okay? I'm great.

202
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:01,880
I'm just--I'm just proud of us.

203
00:12:02,140 --> 00:12:05,280
You know? There's no weirdness, no tension.

204
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:06,780
No awareness.

205
00:12:08,420 --> 00:12:10,160
We make a great foursome.

206
